%N A402023 Decimal expansion of L'(1,chi_{-19})/L(1,chi_{-19}) negated, where chi_{-19} is the Dirichlet character kronecker(-19,.).
%F A402023 Equals A402011 - Sum_{a=1..18} Legendre(a,19)*log Gamma(a/19).
%e A402023 L'(1,chi_{-19})/L(1,chi_{-19}) = -0.08491368178771158850...
%o A402023 (PARI) f(D) = my(L=lfuncreate(D)); lfun(L,1,1)/lfun(L,1,0); \\ D is a fundamental discriminant
%o A402023 f(-19)
%o A402023 (PARI) f(D) = my(h = qfbclassno(D)); log(2*Pi) + Euler() - (1/h) * sum(a=1, abs(D), kronecker(D,a)*lngamma(a/abs(D))); \\ D < -4 is a fundamental discriminant
%o A402023 f(-19)
%Y A402023 Cf. A011585 (chi_{-19}). See A402011 for related sequences.
